<title>USA: Wall Street opens mixed.</title>
<headline>Wall Street opens mixed.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wall Street opened mixed on Wednesday with investors focused on both the technology sector, which slumped yesterday, and bond yields</p>
<p>The Dow industrials were off 10.30 at 7301.85 points while the Nasdaq composite started higher, up 2.51 points, at 1387.42.</p>
</text>
